@startuml Reservation State Pattern

title State Pattern - Reservation

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam linetype ortho

class Reservation <<Context>> {
    - id: Long
    - createdAt: LocalDateTime
    - state: ReservationState
    + confirm(): void
    + cancel(): void
    + setState(state: ReservationState): void
}

interface ReservationState <<State>> {
    + confirm(reservation: Reservation): void
    + cancel(reservation: Reservation): void
}

class PendingReservationState <<ConcreteState>> {
    + confirm(reservation: Reservation): void
    + cancel(reservation: Reservation): void
}

class ReservedReservationState <<ConcreteState>> {
    + confirm(reservation: Reservation): void
    + cancel(reservation: Reservation): void
}

Reservation --> ReservationState : current state

ReservationState <|.. PendingReservationState
ReservationState <|.. ReservedReservationState

PendingReservationState ..> ReservedReservationState : transition on confirm()

note right of PendingReservationState
    Reservation is waiting
    for payment.

    confirm():
    transition to RESERVED

    cancel():
    remove reservation
end note

note right of ReservedReservationState
    Reservation has already
    been confirmed.

    confirm():
    no state change

    cancel():
    cancel reservation
end note

@enduml